This project began as an import of parts of GroceryClaw
(https://github.com/vansyson1308/groceryclaw, commit 0fb3af4, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 vansyson1308 and GroceryClaw contributors):

- apps/mcp-server   (ShopVoice MCP server, OAuth 2.1, public pages)
- apps/console      (originally apps/alexa-sim)
- packages/common
- db/migrations 001-018 and db/seed
- supporting scripts, tests and tools

The import is the first commit of this repository ("Import from groceryclaw
@0fb3af4 (MIT)"). Everything after it was built during the PayPal AI
Hackathon; see BUILT_DURING_PAYPAL.md.

